      "description": "ESP PLANTS live Waveshare 7B UI. EEZ Studio owns all static 1024x600 layout: header, bottom navigation, Home, All Sensors, Plant Detail, Settings, Advanced Zigbee, Network & Updates, Release Notes, rename/personality, pair/remove, and Wi-Fi confirmation overlays. Runtime data, virtualized sensor/repeater rows, QR canvas pixels, callbacks, Zigbee, Wi-Fi, OTA, and persistence remain native firmware. LVGL 8.3, no EEZ Flow.",
